{{Wireless adapter |brand=Unex |model=DAXA-90 |is_manuf=No |manuf=Wistron NeWeb |est_release_date=02/2012 |fcc_id=NKRDAXA-92 |pcb_id=48DAXA01.SGA |if=Mini PCIe (oversized) |chip1_brand=Qualcomm Atheros |chip1_model=QCA9890 |accessible_UART=No |ant_conn=U.FL |802dot11_protocols=an+ac |txchains=3 |rxchains=3 |sstreams=3 }}
:{{ProductPage|https://www.unex.com.tw/products/wi-fi/throughput/80211ac/pcie/detail/daxa-92}}
"48DAXA01.SGA" and "2012/02/01" is silkscreened on the board. :OEM: [[Wistron NeWeb]] (DAXA-90/DAXA-92)
Additional specifications, per '''Unex'''s product page, follow.. *PAMs: ''[[Skyworks]]'' SE5003L1 *Dimension: [[Dimensions::50 mm (W) x 50.8 mm (L)]]
Features 5GHz 802.11ac 3x3 and external Rx filter, DAXA-90 delivers up to 1.3Gbps data rate :and provides the excellent radio rejection against the interfering signal from the 2nd 2.4GHz :Wi-Fi module on dual-band dual con-current applications.
